  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<p>Course: SCI-6476 Transformable Design MethodsInstructor: Chuck HobermanProject Duration: 6 Weeks<br>Team members: Kai Zhang, Quincy Kuang, Danning LiangSpeacial Thanks: Youtian Duan(Welding), Liu Yang(Assembly)</p>",
   "kind": "credits",
   "layout": "credits"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<p>My Role:<br>[1] Proposed the innovative concept of combining mirror and prismatic structures to create a transformable lighting solution.<br>[2] Conducted research into both design directions and developed a Grasshopper C# script to streamline the design and simulation process for the team.<br>[3] Defined the aesthetic and specifications of the final product.<br>[4] Worked closely with two other team members to address the challenges in the actuation, lighting, and connection design.</p>",
   "kind": "credits",
   "layout": "credits"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<h2>What will an \"Inside-Out\" kaleidoscope look like?</h2>",
   "layout": "quote",
   "kind": "quote"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "prismo/02.jpg",
   "width": 2400,
   "height": 1600,
   "kind": "photo"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<p>Prismo lamp is a modern interpretation of the classic prismatic structure, leveraging its periodic and space-filling properties to create a unique, kinetic aesthetic.</p>",
   "layout": "text-l",
   "kind": "text"
  },
  {
   "type": "row",
   "columns": [
    {
     "flex": 0.645,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p>Initial InspirationI was first intrigued by the prismatic structure’s movement. The mesmerizing yet unexpected movement makes me wonder how will light bounces inside this structure. A whim suddenly hit me: Why don’t combine periscope and prismatic structure and make an \"inside-out kaleidoscope\", using prismatic transformation to amplify light?</p>",
       "kind": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "flex": 0.355,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "loop",
       "src": "/media/prismo/03.mp4",
       "width": 600,
       "height": 600,
       "kind": "small"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "kind": "row"
  },
