      {
       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p>Parametric Design<br>I wrote a C# grasshopper script to streamline the design and simulation process for 1 DOF prismatic structures, greatly improving our ability to iterate and refine the design in a timely manner.<br><br><br><strong><a href=\"/transform\">Click here to see how I improved the workflow in details</a> &gt;&gt;&gt;</strong></p>",
       "kind": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "flex": 0.625,
     "blocks": [
      {
