    {
     "flex": 0.275,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "html": "<h3>Actuation</h3>\n<p>The lamp’s movement is driven by the actuation of its base parallelogram. By fixing one side of the parallelogram to the base, we were able to drive the whole structure by actuating the non-fixed side using a servo motor.</p>",
       "kind": "text"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "layout": "grid3",
   "kind": "row"
  },
  {
   "type": "gallery",
   "items": [
